# Cloudflare Pages — redirects.
# `/_redirects` maps clean paths to the site's entry points. The site is a set
# of static HTML entry points (index, /admin/, /smithy/) — no SPA fallback is
# needed, so only legacy/clean paths are mapped.

# Clean entry points — the demos live under subdirectories.
/admin        /admin/index.html    200
/smithy       /smithy/index.html   200
# The Forge control panel was renamed Smithy — keep the old path working.
/forge        /smithy/index.html   301

# A convenience alias for the demos tab on the front page.
/demo         /#interactive-demonstrators    302
